# Prefer the SSO login command documented in stevenclarke-infrastructure:
#   aws codeartifact login --tool npm --namespace @stevenclarke ...
# It writes the scoped registry and a short-lived auth token to ~/.npmrc.
#
# For CI, read the registry URL from /platform/artifacts/codeartifact/npm-registry-url
# and generate a fresh token with `aws codeartifact get-authorization-token`.
@stevenclarke:registry=${CODEARTIFACT_NPM_REGISTRY_URL}
